Description Task 1: Fetch the names of all nodes in the Kubernetes cluster using kubectl. The command should be executed without headers and with a custom output format to extract the node names.

Task 2: Restore etcd - remove old nodes
Description Task 2: Remove nodes from the Kubernetes cluster that are not part of the current RKE2 cluster group. This is done by comparing the list of nodes obtained previously with the current group names and then deleting the nodes that do not match. The command uses the delete node operation with kubectl.


